ne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/31a3e5852c510a06c2deebdab55f1c97.poster.avif?t=1760716109\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/31a3e5852c510a06c2deebdab55f1c97.webm?t=1760716109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/31a3e5852c510a06c2deebdab55f1c97.mp4?t=1760716109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Complete the tasks and collect the items stolen by Oyen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Looking for a challenge? Try the sepia mode!<br>Mastered all the photos? Test your speed in timer mode and set a new record!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/c81fa7167fdb3615313064fa52cf47ac.poster.avif?t=1760716109\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/c81fa7167fdb3615313064fa52cf47ac.webm?t=1760716109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/c81fa7167fdb3615313064fa52cf47ac.mp4?t=1760716109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690390?t=1760716109","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/304b7aa1f41dfa1c09a558c3ee8c1c8c8c230f00/page_bg_