0390/extras/3f6c912ee660f7abd9b156dbd439d351.poster.avif?t=1760716109\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/3f6c912ee660f7abd9b156dbd439d351.webm?t=1760716109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/3f6c912ee660f7abd9b156dbd439d351.mp4?t=1760716109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A short game, simple and quick gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/4b98be670725fe5e916cea81bfb7ae80.poster.avif?t=1760716109\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/4b98be670725fe5e916cea81bfb7ae80.webm?t=1760716109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/4b98be670725fe5e916cea81bfb7ae80.mp4?t=1760716109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">12 photo categories to explore, with 9 fun photos in each one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/31a3e5852c510a06c2deebdab55f1c97.poster.avif?t=1760716109\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/31a3e5852c510a06c2deebdab55f1c97.webm?t=1760716109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/369039